# API Configuration

# Google Gemini API Key (Optional - for better AI-powered features)
# Get your free API key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# Note: The app works with a demo key, but you can add your own for higher limits
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Note:
# - Translation uses MyMemory API (free, no key required)
# - AI generation uses Google Gemini API (free tier available)
